      "body": "ACK\r\n\r\nHi everyone, I reviewed the changes in this PR and tested the benchmark locally. I checked the BnB search logic as well as the assumptions used in make_hard_case(). I built bench_bitcoin with the changes from this PR and ran the BnBExhaustion benchmark. The benchmark completed successfully with exit code 0, and all the new assertions passed. The results confirm that the benchmark reaches the limit of 100,000 evaluations. ✌🏻",
